"<h1 id="aegis-dispatch">Aegis Dispatch<a class="heading-anchor" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" href="#aegis-dispatch">#</a></h1>
<p><a href="https://github.com/Decuayer/aegis-dispatch/actions" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="https://github.com/Decuayer/aegis-dispatch/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg" alt="CI" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" class="readme-badge"></a> <img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/TypeScript-5-blue" alt="TypeScript" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" class="readme-badge"></p>
<p>Emergency dispatch simulator 🚨</p>
<p><img src="https://cdn.test/media/github/x/architecture.png" alt="Architecture" width="800" height="600" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<div class="markdown-alert markdown-alert-note"><p class="markdown-alert-title"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true" class="octicon"><path d="M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z"></path></svg>Note</p>
